# Build context hygiene for the frontend image.
# node_modules is reinstalled with `npm ci` inside the build stage so the
# lockfile - not the host's platform-specific tree - decides the dependencies.

### Secrets ###
.env
.env.*
!.env.production.example

### Dependencies and build output (regenerated in the build stage) ###
node_modules/
dist/
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

### Caches and logs ###
.eslintcache
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
coverage/

### Docs and VCS metadata ###
.git/
.gitignore
*.md

### Editor / OS ###
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
